    {
      "text": "buried in a good old age, Gen. 15:15. Abraham and Sarah were old and well stricken in age, Gen. 18:11. bare Abraham a son in his old age, Gen. 21:2. died in a good old age, an old man, Gen. 25:8. Moses said, We will go with our young and with our old, Ex. 10:9. a nourisher of thine old age, Ruth 4:15. he forsook the counsel of the old men, 1 Kgs. 12:8 (2 Chr. 10:8). With the ancient is wisdom, Job 12:12. Cast me not off in the time of old age, Ps. 71:9. shall still bring forth fruit in old age, Ps. 92:14. beauty of old men is the gray head, Prov. 20:29. even to your old age I am he, Isa. 46:4. old man that hath not filled his days, Isa. 65:20. old men shall dream dreams, Joel 2:28 (Acts 2:17). There shall yet old men and old women dwell in … Jerusalem, Zech. 8:4.",
